# 공공데이터포털에서 발급받은 Decoding 인증키. 포털 API 활용신청 후 입력.
DATA_GO_KR_SERVICE_KEY=

# Supabase PostgreSQL connection string from the project's Connect dialog.
# Keep the real value only in the ignored local .env or a server secret store.
SUPABASE_DB_URL=

# Optional dedicated read-only login DSN for the analysis container.
# Until set, analysis uses SUPABASE_DB_URL with SET ROLE and read-only transaction.
SUPABASE_ANALYSIS_DB_URL=

# Optional internal n8n production webhook override for the analysis UI.
YONGIN_ANALYSIS_WEBHOOK_URL=

# Container data root; local CLI defaults to <repository>/data.
YONGIN_DATA_DIR=
